# Line endings are a property of this project, not of the machine that cloned
# it: the working tree here is currently mixed (game.ts CRLF, app.ts LF), and
# core.autocrlf is a per-machine setting that does not travel with the repo.
# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository; checkouts still get the
# platform's own endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.pdn  binary
